 "sayLines": [
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Your understanding is... deepening! We can see it! Like watching a seed decide to be a tree! Beautiful! Profitable!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Aria speaks at Emberhold's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Aria speaks at Stonebridge's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Aria speaks at Thornfield's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "Deeper knowledge: Burdock. Uses: starchy root vegetable. Dig first-year plants (no flower stalk). (+5 health when eaten). All uses known: food: first-year roots only — dig deep, peel, cook like carrots; medicine: root tea, traditional blood purifier; fiber: tough stalk fiber for rough cordage."
  },
  {
   "day": 35,
   "text": "✨ Ability gained: Fusion Reactor (L1). The System installs your fusion pellet — properly, inside you. You never need to eat again: the pellet covers your metabolism, and your strikes and abilities burn with a steady reactor fire (1.25x, always on). One reactor per world, and it never comes out: not unslotted, not un-taught, not surrendered. Death is the only uninstall. But the hunger is gone, and "
  },
  {
   "day": 57,
   "text": "🧳 The trader lowers their voice. \"And further still — FOUR fires under one head. They call it a REALM. Tribute flows uphill like a river; I saw the grain carts with my own eyes.\" They won't say more. Or can't."
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four fires. One head. GOVERNANCE LAYER: online — polity tribute routing, the court calendar, famine reserves. You built a realm. Try not to lose it the way you found it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "📓 Codex: National beat staged: lead (4 villages)."
  },
  {
   "day": 77,
   "text": "🍲 The shared granary opens: 5,000 kcal for every fire of the realm, no strings. Emberhold, Stonebridge, Thornfield count it — and remember who fed them first. (Trust +10 with each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 77,
   "text": "◈ SYSTEM: \"32. You see the number. THE WORLD IS WATCHING. Broadcast tier: planetary — the audience has picked its favorite fire and it is YOURS. This is not the table. The table comes later. Tonight, the galaxy wants a show.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 77,
   "text": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Oh. OH. Do you feel that? That's the whole PLANET leaning in. ...There's a table, little fires. A big one. Far away. And it is LOOKING at you. Give it a season worth judging.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 78,
   "text": "📡 Haven feasts for the cameras — 5,040 kcal of theater, every fire of the realm at the table. The chat eats it up. Somewhere, the table makes a note."
  },
  {
   "day": 78,
   "text": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Species agency: unlocked. You are not at the table yet. But the table has your name now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "Aroha, at the fire, not quite believing it: \"Speakers rode in, ate our grain, and called us a realm. A REALM. I keep saying it to hear how it sounds.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 90,
   "text": "◈ THE TABLE — the ring of pale light flickers at the edge of the sky... and does not come. The System does not apologize this time. \"WE PRICED THE RUN. NO HUNGER ON THE RECORD — THE PELLET HUMS WHERE THE FIRE SHOULD BE. NO FEAST, NO SURGE, NOTHING HERE WE CAN PRICE. A COLD SPOT AT EVERY TABLE: THE WORDS WERE ON THE WRAPPER.\" The ledger still wants: wave-3 monsters faced. The mantle may pass to hun"
  },
  {
   "day": 157,
   "text": "📓 Codex: you've heard of **Harvest Table**. Someone, somewhere, can do this. Now you know its name."
  },
  {
   "day": 157,
   "text": "◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Enrique — Combat 1. Three offers; they took Harvest Table. Earned, chosen. (harvest_table: villager level-up)"
  },
  {
   "day": 157,
   "text": "📓 Codex: Enrique chose Harvest Table (harvest_table) at Combat 1."
  }
 ],
